   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "The Destiny Collection exudes a classic, minimalist design and is powered by the American built Ameriquartz 7320b movement. The watch’s 42mm case features both polished and brushed finishes to accentuate the smooth elements of the watch and to highlight the juxtaposition of the rounded bezel and polished lugs with the thin brushed case. Finely-chiseled baton markers are applied to the circular grain dial, with both the hour marks and hands coated with C3 Super Lumi-Nova ® , whose greenish hue is the brightest in the industry. The interior of the watch’s flat sapphire crystal is layered with anti-reflective coating to avoid any glares when looking at the dial. The polished Milanese bracelets of the Destiny Collection are quick-release, allowing the wearer to easily change bracelets and straps to customize the look and feel of the watch. Your Destiny timepiece will be the most versatile watch in your wardrobe (especially if coupled with a handmade Lineage leather band) – from Sunday brunch in Coronado, or a night out on the town in Gaslamp, to the office in the Financial District, or at a wedding ceremony in Old Town.",
