   "description": "A classic, heritage-style timepiece for every day wearing, yet styled for those most important of occasions. Designed, engineered, and hand-assembled in the United States, the Legacy Collection boasts the Americhron 7A20 automatic movement, also built in America. The two-level dial is adorned with polished Roman numeral markers which match the finely polished bezel and 39mm case (a size that will suit any wrist). It’s three (3) hands feature the Super Lumi-Nova® BGW9 lume, whose bluish hue is the longest lasting on the market. With an exhibition caseback (showing the Americhron at work), flat sapphire crystal layered with anti-reflective coating, and sophisticated quick-release jubilee bracelet, with both brushed and polished links, this is the elegant American watch you have been waiting for.",
